Z||000002||pherder||05-02-2001||10:18 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Tom88gt:<BR><B>YOU should have gone the the Fiero Factory swap meet last weekend.  Someone was selling an under chassis stiffening kit for the Fiero.  Don't remember who or if it sold.  But there was one there to buy.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well, that was mine.  It sat at the Fiero Factory for 1 year without selling.  MrFiero (Mike Valentine) was going to buy it but changed his mind and told Tim @ FieroParts.com about it and Tim bought it from me.  Mike picked it up while at the swap meet to deliver it to Tim.  Mike told me he could have sold it several times during his stay but I had already been paid for it and Tim wouldn't have been very happy with us!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Paul<P>||||reg||6
