Z||000012||lowCG||05-06-2001||11:43 AM||||I was looking a little last year,and the only thing found was a kit leftover from a kit project.If the gas tank will be removed permanently then I would just weld a few pieces of square tube to the floor since it's so flat down there.An X is prefered,and you could probably find a trailer hitch place,or someone working out of their garage to do the welding as long as you took your carpets out first.||||reg||1
